msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Liste de contrôle de migration"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:159
msgid "For a clean port to v3.6.1 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Pour un portage propre vers la v3.6.1, le travail typique est :"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:161
msgid ""
"Remove :func:`sensor.set_framerate` calls (:ref:`the set_framerate removal "
"<v3_6_1_setframerate>`)."
msgstr ""
"Supprimer les appels à :func:`sensor.set_framerate` (:ref:`la suppression de"
" set_framerate <v3_6_1_setframerate>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:163
msgid ""
"Move TensorFlow workloads off the OpenMV Cam M7 (:ref:`the M7 TensorFlow "
"change <v3_6_1_tfm7>`)."
msgstr ""
"Déplacer les charges de travail TensorFlow hors de l'OpenMV Cam M7 (:ref:`le"
" changement TensorFlow sur le M7 <v3_6_1_tfm7>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:165
msgid ""
"Stop relying on the return value of ``set_pixformat()`` / "
"``set_framesize()`` and catch ``ValueError`` for unsupported pixel formats "
"(:ref:`the return-value change <v3_6_1_setreturn>`)."
msgstr ""
"Cesser de s'appuyer sur la valeur de retour de ``set_pixformat()`` / "
"``set_framesize()`` et intercepter ``ValueError`` pour les formats de pixel "
"non pris en charge (:ref:`le changement de valeur de retour "
"<v3_6_1_setreturn>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:168
msgid ""
"Ensure even image dimensions before ``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` / "
"``logpolar()`` (:ref:`the even-dimension requirement <v3_6_1_evendims>`)."
msgstr ""
"Garantir des dimensions d'image paires avant ``lens_corr()`` / "
"``linpolar()`` / ``logpolar()`` (:ref:`l'exigence de dimensions paires "
"<v3_6_1_evendims>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:171
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Tous les autres scripts s'exécutent sans modification."
